layout, gradient effects and glass-navigation components from Mercury000/SonyPods.
SonyPods is licensed under GNU GPL v3; YktWx is distributed under the same license.
A complete GPL v3 copy is included in LICENSE. Provide corresponding source with
any APK redistribution. No SonyPods original project files were modified.

Apache-2.0 components and adaptation references:
- compose-miuix-ui/miuix, including blur and icons
- AndroidX / Jetpack Compose
- JetBrains Kotlin and kotlinx.coroutines
- ZXing core
- Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass (glass-effect adaptation reference)
Individual source headers have been retained. Upstream project links are
available in the app's About → Open-source projects page.

YktWx is an unofficial personal client for the user's own campus-card account.
It is not affiliated with the university or the campus-card service provider.
No account credentials, tokens or actual payment codes are included in source,
artwork, screenshots, tests or APK assets.
